  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Online Dairy Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information in the Ukrainian Dairy sector is scattered. This project will provide a platform that serves an centralized hub of information for the Ukrainian dairy sector. The platform will entail important information on relevant (European Union (EU)) rules &amp; regulations, market data, an EU roadmap, news updates and company directories. This platform also serves as a tool to link key stakeholders, both domestically and internationally with the Ukrainian dairy sector. In order to stimulate a resilient dairy sector and to help the sector with EU integration and EU market access.</narrative>
  </description>
